cff-version: 1.2.0
title: groundlens
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it. Note that performance figures
  published by this project before v3.0.0 have been withdrawn and should not
  be cited.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Marin
    given-names: Javier
repository-code: https://github.com/groundlens-dev/groundlens
url: https://groundlens.dev
abstract: >-
  GroundLens is an execution verification runtime for agentic AI systems. It
  checks an answer or a whole agent run against its sources: exact checks for
  figures, arithmetic, scope and the kind of answer asked for, and optionally a
  judge that is the user's own model and can only escalate. A versioned policy
  turns the evidence into PASS, REVIEW or FAIL, and every decision is sealed in
  a signed, hash-chained record that anyone can verify offline.
license: Apache-2.0
version: 5.3.0
date-released: '2026-09-22'
